        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "🚀 What is GPSOnPower?",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**GPSOnPower** acts as a smart location manager and anti-theft companion to help you preserve battery life without compromising device security.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "✨ Features in v1.0 (Initial Release)",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "### 🔋 Power-Based GPS Toggling\n- **Location OFF**: When unplugged, Location Services are automatically disabled to save maximum battery.\n- **Location ON**: Connecting to any power source (Wired, Qi, MagSafe) instantly enables Location Services.\n\n### 🛡️ Anti-Theft & Safe Wi-Fi Geofencing\n- **Safe Wi-Fi Networks**: Define a list of \"Safe\" Wi-Fi networks in preferences (e.g., Home or Work).\n- **Smart Geofencing**: Disconnecting from Safe Wi-Fi forces Location Services ON regardless of power state, ensuring your device remains trackable in public.\n- **Interactive Network List**: Easily manage safe SSIDs directly in tweak settings.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "📦 Installation & Setup",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- **Install**: Download `com.nanerasingh.gpsonpower_1.0_iphoneos-arm64.deb` and install via Sileo or Zebra.\n- **Environment**: Built for modern rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine / Palera1n).\n- **Configure**: Go to **Settings > GPSOnPower** to manage Safe Wi-Fi networks.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
